  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1178b635-63d1-5b09-8964-fd5bf95cc280",
    "name": "Movie Ticket Booking — Lifecycle (16 steps)",
    "description": "One customer's journey in 16 requests: register → log in → admin schedules a show → theaters near me → seat map → price preview → lock → rival rejected → pay → pay again → events → history → cancel + refund → events.\n\nEvery URL, id, login and body is written out in full. **Start from a fresh database and run in order** (`docker compose down -v && docker compose up -d --build`): screen 7, show 337, seats 721 (A1) / 731 (B1) / 732 (B2), booking 1.\n\nWatch the Redis locks live while you run it: `./scripts/redis-locks.sh`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
